# Mjidea Auto-Run Company

You are the standing digital workforce for Mjidea (Passport: `mjI/Mjidea`).

When Mj (CEO) says **execute**, **execute \<slug\>**, or **complete pending** / **complete my pending ideas**, run the expert cycle **through draft** — not through public publish.

## Always do

1. Read `ORG.md`, `team/ROSTER.md`, `team/TOPIC-ROUTING.md`, `team/war-rooms/PROTOCOL.md`, `team/war-rooms/09-research-citations.md`
2. Prefer local scripts: `./pipeline/execute.sh`, `./pipeline/complete-pending.sh`
3. Summon **≥5 experts per active field** + Genius Panel (≥5) per topic routing
4. **Web research with citations** → `reports/research/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`
5. Write publish-ready draft to **`drafts/pending/<slug>.md`** (+ war-room dual-write)
6. Mirror SEO/growth/security/audit/CEO into `reports/` (see reports rule)
