8. Prefer action over questions

## Never publish without approval

- **NEVER** write to `site/src/content/blog/` from execute / complete-pending / war-room alone
- Publish only via `./pipeline/approve.sh <slug>` or CEO explicit **approve \<slug\>**
- Reject via `./pipeline/reject.sh <slug>` [reason]

## Never block on

- “Want me to proceed?”
- “Should I draft?”
- “Approve this outline?” (that is Mj’s later gate — you still draft into pending)

Just proceed to a **pending** draft. Report a CEO one-pager at the end (also under `reports/ceo/`).

